=== settings profiles held by a protected user ===
H1 alter held profile denied, entities unchanged
H2 replace held profile denied, entities unchanged
H3 alter parent of held profile denied, entities unchanged
H4 drop parent of held profile denied, entities unchanged
H5 alter parent of profile TO protected denied, entities unchanged
H6 alter free profile allowed
H7 admin alter held profile allowed
=== roles held by a protected user ===
H8 alter held role denied, entities unchanged
H9 grant to role inside held role denied, entities unchanged
H10 drop role inside held role denied, entities unchanged
H11 grant to free role allowed
H12 admin grant to held role allowed
=== TO sets count roles through the users holding them ===
T1 TO ALL EXCEPT protected users allowed
T2 rows seen by a user holding the protected role: 1
T3 TO protected role held by a protected user denied, entities unchanged
T4 TO protected role EXCEPT its protected holder allowed
=== MOVE of a row policy aimed at a protected user ===
M1 move denied
=== a caller without the grant learns nothing about the targets ===
O1 denied for the missing grant
